        "a": "An AP style converter rewrites text from another style, such as Chicago or a house style, into AP style: numbers, dates, titles, commas and composition titles. No converter is reliable without review. The safest way is the AI prompt on this page in \"convert\" mode, with every change listed so an editor can approve it."
