        "a": "They serve different markets. AP is the default for U.S. newspapers, broadcast news, wire services and most PR. Chicago is the default for U.S. book publishing and is common in history, the arts and some magazines. Academic writers in the sciences and social sciences more often use APA, and humanities students MLA."
