    "slug": "levels-of-evidence-and-study-types",
    "title": "Levels of Evidence: Study Types and Which Papers to Trust",
    "heading": "Levels of evidence: study types and which papers to trust first",
    "description": "Levels of evidence explained: every major study type in one table, the evidence pyramid and its limits, and how to filter a search by study type.",
    "primaryKeyword": "levels of evidence",
