    "title": "How to Organize Research Papers So You Can Find Them",
    "heading": "How to organize research papers so you can find them again",
    "description": "How to organize research papers: folders or tags, a PDF naming rule, notes that stay with each paper, duplicates, reading status and a weekly routine.",
