    "heading": "How to write a research question that you can actually answer",
    "description": "Learn how to write a research question in four steps, test it with FINER, frame it with PICO, PCC or SPIDER, and see weak questions fixed across five fields.",
    "primaryKeyword": "how to write a research question",
