        "a": "Use whatever your department's room and your examiners can open reliably. PowerPoint is the safest choice for a shared room computer. Bring a PDF copy as a backup, since PDFs keep fonts and layout on any machine. If you present online, test screen sharing and presenter view in the same software the committee will use."
