        "a": "In most fields, yes. APA Style supports the first person and the active voice when you describe what you did ('I interviewed 18 managers'), and many examiners prefer it to long passive sentences. Some departments and journals in the sciences still favor the passive for routine procedures. Follow your university's style guide and keep one approach throughout the chapter."
