        "a": "It can help you check the revised manuscript before you resubmit: an AI reviewer can score the paper against review criteria and point to unclear passages, much as a peer reviewer would. It can also help find papers a reviewer asked you to cite. It cannot decide which comments to accept, run your new analyses or write replies you haven't checked against the paper."
