        "a": "Yes, for parts of the work. AI can suggest search terms and archives, summarize secondary literature, help you read a difficult passage, draft translations for you to check, and test whether your argument holds together. It cannot replace reading the primary sources, and it may invent quotations, dates and references. Verify every fact and quote against the source itself before it goes into your notes."
